# Clang-Format

After editing any C++ file, run clang-format **20.1.6** with the repo-root `.clang-format` on every touched file before you stop.

```bash
clang-format -i <edited-files>
```

Do not leave include-order, wrapping, or spacing for the user to catch. An unformatted C++ change is not finished.
